## This month at Soup House

**What an amazing November!** \
\
We made so many friends and saw the start of an incredible community of soupers. Our Soupsgiving Dinner on November 19th fed 40 people and we still had too much food! Folks went home with three boxes each of turkey, stuffing, mashed potatoes, greens, casseroles, and rolls, all whipped up from scratch in the kitchen. \
\
And another thing that happened in November: we finally put a newsletter together! We didn't expect to see so many folks sign up on our website, but we're so glad to have the interest. \
\


{% figure src="https://media.souphouse.org/newsletter/2026/11/1f071b82-signal-2026-11-14-19-09-57-880.jpg" /%}

